{"id":1828652,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-18T19:30:18.742Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/w9ss1N762awNZPSil7yu58D9BxQ.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":5000,"genres":[{"id":18,"name":"Drama"}],"homepage":"","id":1828652,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["TR"],"original_language":"tr","original_title":"60 SANİYE","overview":"Aslı leads a comfortable life with her two children until a devastating earthquake strikes one night, just as she is putting her daughter Eda to bed after taking her away from the piano. Having lost her home, Aslı seeks refuge with her children at the home of her close friend Nazan in Istanbul. Nazan, who has two children of her own, one with a disability, opens her home to them despite her family responsibilities. However, as Aslı’s efforts to find a job, a new home, and schools for her children prove unsuccessful, their stay grows longer. Tensions rise within the household, partly due to the behavior of Aslı’s young son Ege, and the dynamics between the two families begin to shift. Faced with Nazan’s growing frustration and complaints, Aslı finds herself caught between her struggle to build a secure future for her children and the painful feeling of being unwelcome in the very home where she has sought refuge.","popularity":0.0582,"poster_path":"/eoI3yxlHWJ7Ot7OlCoWSSq0KKma.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"TR","name":"Turkey"}],"release_date":"2023-09-20","revenue":0,"runtime":8,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Turkish","iso_639_1":"tr","name":"Türkçe"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"No rubble weighs heavier than the burden of a mother who feels helpless for her children.","title":"60 SECONDS","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":6601149,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Özgen Zeybek","original_name":"Özgen Zeybek","popularity":0.1831,"profile_path":"/avp1IrXU4stIkXF3WseG